abstract: >-
  A stewardship instrument for maintained commitments: systems, obligations,
  and relationships to past work. Reads a declared file of commitments
  against a versioned registry and returns a fail-closed declaration-
  coverage verdict. Never a warranty, SLA, or proof of maintenance.
